# fastlane/play-store-key.json
#
# This file is a placeholder. The real service-account JSON key must NEVER be
# committed to source control.
#
# ── How to generate it ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Open Google Play Console → Setup → API access
# 2. Link to (or create) a Google Cloud project
# 3. Create a service account with the role "Release Manager"
# 4. Download the JSON key and save it here as play-store-key.json
#    (this .gitignore entry already excludes it)
# 5. Or set the PLAY_STORE_JSON_KEY environment variable to its path
#
# Fastlane docs: https://docs.fastlane.tools/getting-started/android/setup/
#
# ⚠️  play-store-key.json is listed in .gitignore — the real file will NOT be
#      committed even if you place it here.
